ui.aoc:info.alloy_forge=Alloy Forge\n§7Combines ingredient stacks into advanced alloys.\n§7Place ingredients in any of the 9 input slots.
ui.aoc:info.fluid_storage=Stores up to seven fluids in independent tanks.\n\nMultiblock IO:\n- Each fluid valve can target Any Tank or a specific tank 1-7\n- Every tank supports input and output
ui.aoc:info.fuel_burner=Burns stored liquid fuel to generate §eDE§r.\n\nMultiblock IO:\n- Fluid input: fuel tank\n- Energy: exported through energy valves
ui.aoc:info.greenhouse=Industrial 5×5×5 greenhouse that grows up to 4 crops simultaneously.\n\nSlots:\n- Seeds: 4 seed slots (mix any types)\n- Soil: 1 slot (affects speed & yield)\n- Output: 9 harvest slots\n\nFluids:\n- Fertilizer tank: boosts crop yield (optional)\n- Growth Solution tank: boosts processing speed (optional)\n\nSoils — cost / yield multiplier:\n  Dirt ×2 cost / ×1 yield\n  Grass Block ×1.5 / ×1\n  Yellow Soil ×1 / ×1\n  Red Soil ×0.75 / ×2\n  Blue Soil ×0.5 / ×3\n  Black Soil ×0.25 / ×4\n\nFertilizers:\n  Organic — ×1.10 yield, 100 mB/cycle\n  Enriched — ×1.25 yield, 80 mB/cycle\n  Industrial — ×1.50 yield, 60 mB/cycle\n\nGrowth Solutions:\n  Bio — ×1.20 speed, 100 mB/cycle\n  Nutrient — ×1.40 speed, 80 mB/cycle\n  Advanced Catalyst — ×1.70 speed, 60 mB/cycle\n\nRequires: 1 Industrial Energy Port, 2 Industrial Fluid Ports, 1 Industrial Item Port\nEnergy buffer: 200,000 DE
ui.aoc:info.industrial_crusher=Processes items through selectable output stages.\n\nInput: 2x2 item grid.\nOutput: 3x3 result grid.\n\nStages:\n- 1x: First breakdown\n- 2x: Second breakdown\n- 3x: Third breakdown\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.aoc:info.nuclear_processor=Converts Thorium Concentrate into Actinide Solution.\n\nInput: 20 Thorium Concentrate\nOutput: 100 mB Actinide Solution\nEnergy: 50,000 KDe\n\nAccepted Upgrades:\n- Speed\n- Energy
ui.aoc:info.nuclear_reactor=3×3×3 nuclear fission reactor.\n\nConsumes §eLiquified Thorium§r and a §bcoolant§r to generate §eDE§r, with §2Nuclear Waste§r as a byproduct.\n\nCoolants and their speed multipliers:\n  §fWater §7— ×1.0 speed, 150 mB/cycle\n  §bSaline Coolant §7— ×1.5 speed, 100 mB/cycle\n  §3Liquid Nitrogen §7— ×2.0 speed, 60 mB/cycle\n\nWithout coolant: ×0.5 speed, no fluid cost.\n\nPer reaction cycle:\n  §cThorium consumed: §f50 mB\n  §eEnergy produced:  §f50 000 DE\n  §2Waste produced:   §f10 mB\n\nThrottles automatically when energy buffer reaches 95%%.\nRequires: §92× Industrial Fluid Port  §e1× Industrial Energy Port
ui.aoc:info.polymerizer=Converts Plastic Resin into HDPE Pellets.\n\nInput: 250 mB Plastic Resin\nOutput: 1 HDPE Pellet\nEnergy: 10,000 KDe
ui.aoc:info.refinery=Processes one input fluid into up to three refinery products.\n\nMultiblock IO:\n- Fluid input: source tank\n- Fluid outputs: product tanks 1-3\n- Energy: accepted through energy valves
ui.aoc:info.stellar_energy_reactor=3×3×3 multiblock generator that consumes Nether Stars and converts them into massive amounts of §eDE§r.\n\n§lSlots:\n§r- §aSlot 0 (left): §fNether Star input\n- §cSlot 1 (right): §fDead Star output\n\n§lCycle:\n§r- 1 Nether Star per 10s cycle\n- §e5,000,000 DE §rper star\n- §b20% chance§r of Dead Star byproduct\n\n§lBuffer: §r50 MDE\n\n§lRequires:\n§r1× Industrial Casing (structure)\n1× §eIndustrial Energy Port§r (energy export)
