howtoplay.aoc.items.intro=Key items, crafting recipes, and armor stats for Advance Chemistry. Most advanced materials require machines from this addon to produce.
howtoplay.aoc.items.p_adamant_armor=The §5top-tier§r armor set. Crafted at the §bcrafting table§r using §5Adamant Ingots§r (standard armor shapes).\n\n§lStats:§r\n§7Helmet§r      — Protection: §a5§r  Durability: §e6 000§r  Enchantability: 30\n§7Chestplate§r  — Protection: §a13§r Durability: §e6 400§r  Enchantability: 30\n§7Leggings§r    — Protection: §a10§r Durability: §e6 200§r  Enchantability: 30\n§7Boots§r       — Protection: §a5§r  Durability: §e6 000§r  Enchantability: 30\n§7Full Set§r    — Total Protection: §a33§r\n\n§7Repaired with: Adamant Ingot (restores 25%% durability)\n§7Supports armor trims.
howtoplay.aoc.items.p_fluids=§aPlant Oil§r — Dissolution Chamber from seeds.\n§aEthanol§r — Dissolution Chamber from Sugar Cane.\n§6Biofuel§r — Fluid Mixer: Ethanol + Plant Oil.\n§8Hydrocarbon Slurry§r — Chemical Reactor from Biofuel.\n§7Heavy Hydrocarbon§r — Separator output from Hydrocarbon Slurry.\n§dReactive Fluid§r — Separator output from Hydrocarbon Slurry.\n§7Crude Oil§r — Chemical Reactor from Heavy Hydrocarbon.\n§cDiesel§r · §6Petrol§r · §7Naphtha§r — Refinery from Crude Oil.\n§3Plastic Resin§r — Chemical Reactor from Naphtha.\n§cSulfuric Acid§r — Chemical Reactor from Reactive Fluid.\n§bNitrite Compound§r — Fluid Mixer: Organic Fertilizer + Sulfuric Acid.\n§3Liquid Nitrogen§r — Chemical Reactor from Nitrite Compound.\n§eLiquified Thorium§r — Dissolution Chamber from Thorium Chunk.
howtoplay.aoc.items.p_ingredients=§eHDPE Pellet§r — Polymerize 250 mB Plastic Resin. Used in HDPE Sheets.\n§eHDPE Sheet§r — Craft 4 HDPE Pellets into a sheet (crafting table). Used in Adamant Mesh.\n§eLithium Dust§r — Polymerize 250 mB Reactive Fluid. Used in Voltanium Alloy Ingots.\n§eIndustrial Chip§r — Crafted from refined materials. Used in advanced machine recipes.\n§eDuranium Ingot§r — Smelted from Duranium Ore. Core ingredient for Voltanium alloy.\n§eVoltanium Ingot§r — Produced by the Alloy Forge. Required for Adamant and Voltanium equipment.\n§eAdamant Ingot§r — Produced by the Alloy Forge (top-tier). Required for Adamant armor.\n§eAdamant Mesh§r — Crafted from Adamant Ingots. Used in advanced machine components.\n§eThorium Concentrate§r — Processed in the Dissolution Chamber → Liquified Thorium → Nuclear Reactor fuel.
howtoplay.aoc.items.p_voltanium_armor=Crafted at the §bcrafting table§r using §6Voltanium Ingots§r (standard armor shapes).\n\n§lStats:§r\n§7Helmet§r      — Protection: §a4§r  Durability: §e4 221§r  Enchantability: 25\n§7Chestplate§r  — Protection: §a12§r Durability: §e4 776§r  Enchantability: 25\n§7Leggings§r    — Protection: §a9§r  Durability: §e4 665§r  Enchantability: 25\n§7Boots§r       — Protection: §a4§r  Durability: §e4 443§r  Enchantability: 25\n§7Full Set§r    — Total Protection: §a29§r\n\n§7Repaired with: Voltanium Ingot (restores 25%% durability)\n§7Supports armor trims.
howtoplay.aoc.items.p_voltanium_tools=All Voltanium tools are crafted at the §bcrafting table§r using §6Voltanium Ingots§r with standard tool patterns:\n\n§eSword§r · §ePickaxe§r · §eAxe§r · §eShovel§r · §eHoe§r · §eHammer§r (3×3 area mine)\n§ePaxel§r (Pickaxe + Axe + Shovel combined) · §eAIOT§r (all tools combined)\n\nHigh durability and mining speed. Compatible with standard Minecraft enchantments.
