howtoplay.aoc.machines.intro=All singleblock and industrial machines are defined here. Each requires §eDE§r and processes items or fluids. Use the §bIO tab§r on each machine to configure automation.
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_alloy_forge=Combines up to 9 ingredient stacks into §badvanced alloys§r. Inputs are §lunordered§r — place items in any slot.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 150 000 – 300 000 per craft  §7Time:§r 10 seconds\n\n§lRecipes:§r\n\n§6Voltanium Alloy Ingot§r ×4:\n  §7Duranium Ingot§r ×2 + §7Steel Ingot§r ×2 + §eLithium Dust§r ×4 + §7Energized Iron Plate§r ×1\n  Cost: 150 000 DE\n\n§5Adamant Ingot§r ×4:\n  §3HDPE Sheet§r ×2 + §6Voltanium Ingot§r ×4 + §bHeart of the Sea§r ×1 + §7Netherite Dust§r ×2\n  Cost: 300 000 DE
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_chemical_reactor=Processes one or more §bfluid inputs§r into a single §bmain fluid output§r.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 8 400 – 10 000 per craft  §7Time:§r 10 – 12 seconds\n\n§lRecipes:§r\n\n§6Biofuel§r 1 000 mB → §8Hydrocarbon Slurry§r 750 mB §7(9 600 DE)\n§7Heavy Hydrocarbon§r 400 mB → §7Crude Oil§r 250 mB §7(8 400 DE)\n§7Naphtha§r 1 000 mB → §3Plastic Resin§r 750 mB §7(10 000 DE)\n§dReactive Fluid§r 1 000 mB → §cSulfuric Acid§r 750 mB §7(10 000 DE)\n§bNitrite Compound§r 1 000 mB → §3Liquid Nitrogen§r 750 mB §7(10 000 DE)
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_crusher=Processes items through §b3 selectable output stages§r. Each stage produces a different breakdown result.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 2 000 per craft  §7Time:§r 2 seconds\n\nInput: 2×2 item grid. Output: 3×3 result grid.\n\n§7Use the stage selector in the UI to choose the output. For example:\n§fCobblestone§r → Stage 1: Gravel | Stage 2: Dirt | Stage 3: Sand
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_fermenter=Converts organic items into §bfluids§r through fermentation.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 6 400 – 7 800 per batch  §7Time:§r 6 – 10 seconds\n\n§lRecipes:§r\n\n§eWheat / Beetroot / Melon / Pumpkin Seeds§r ×64 → §aPlant Oil§r 1 200 mB\n§eSugar Cane§r ×64 → §aEthanol§r 1 200 mB §740% chance§r §fSugar§r ×15\n§eBone Meal§r ×8 + §eOak Leaves§r ×4 → §aOrganic Fertilizer§r 500 mB\n\nSmaller batches (×8 seeds) produce proportionally less fluid.
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_fuel_mixer=Blends two §bfluid inputs§r into a single §boutput fluid§r.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 6 400 per craft  §7Time:§r 10 seconds\n\n§lRecipes:§r\n\n§aEthanol§r 1 000 mB + §aPlant Oil§r 1 000 mB → §6Biofuel§r 500 mB\n§2Organic Fertilizer§r 1 000 mB + §cSulfuric Acid§r 1 000 mB → §bNitrite Compound§r 500 mB\n\nBoth fluid tanks must be filled before processing begins.
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_polymerizer=Converts §bfluids§r into §bsolid products§r under pressure.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 10 000 per craft  §7Time:§r 5 seconds\n\n§lRecipes:§r\n\n§3Plastic Resin§r 250 mB → §3HDPE Pellet§r ×1\n§dReactive Fluid§r 250 mB → §eLithium Dust§r ×1\n§2Nuclear Waste§r 250 mB → §5Plutonium Pellet§r ×1
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_relic=Uses the current §bdimension§r to determine which §5armor trim templates§r can be recovered.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 25 000 – 80 000 per craft  §7Time:§r 20 seconds\n\n§lDimension pools:§r\n\n§2Overworld§r — Fuel: §bDiamond ×1§r — 25 000 DE\n§fSentry§r 25% · §fCoast§r 20% · §fDune§r 18% · §fWild§r 15% · §fWayfinder§r 10% · §fShaper§r 7% · §fHost§r 5%\n\n§cNether§r — Fuel: §bNetherite Ingot ×1§r — 50 000 DE\n§fRib§r 30% · §fSnout§r 25% · §fBolt/Raiser§r 15% · §fCoast§r 10% · §fDune§r 10% · §fSentry§r 10%\n\n§5End§r — Fuel: §bNetherite Ingot ×1§r — 60 000 DE\n§fSpire§r 35% · §fSilence§r 20% · §fWard§r 15% · §fVex§r 10% · §fEye§r 10% · §fTide§r 5% · §fFlow§r 5%\n\n§lSpecial:§r §bNetherite Ingot ×2§r (any dimension) → §6Smithing Table§r §7(guaranteed, 80 000 DE)
howtoplay.aoc.machines.p_separator=Separates one §bfluid input§r into §btwo fluid outputs§r.\n\n§eDE cost:§r 8 000 per craft\n\n§lRecipe:§r\n\n§8Hydrocarbon Slurry§r 1 000 mB → §7Heavy Hydrocarbon§r 600 mB + §dReactive Fluid§r 350 mB
